taucs.factor.ordering
taucs.ooc                                    ization
taucs.ooc.basename                 string what preordering to use
taucs.ooc.iohandle                 boolean requests out-of-core processing
                                   string path name and base ﬁle name for data ﬁles
taucs.ooc.memory                   pointer pointer to an open taucs_io_handle. Specify either
taucs.solve
                                             this option or the basename option in out-of-core
