                                             dients algorithm; if you do not specify any iterative
                                             solver, the routine will use a direct solve (single appli-
                                             cation of the preconditioner or of the factorization)
Matrix Reordering                                                                                 19

taucs.solve.minres       boolean requests an iterative solve with the  algorithm
taucs.solve.maxits       double maximum number of iterations
taucs.solve.convergetol  double reduction in the norm of the residual that is consid-
taucs.maxdepth
                                   ered convergence
